### 1. ログイン
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "facilityCd": "NKKSBR",
  "dispUserId": "9439236869",
  "password": "piao"
}

### 2. PG_DUMP アップロード
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="uploadType"

PG_DUMP
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="facilityCode"

NKKSBR
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="pg_dump.zip"
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

< E:\tmp\uploads\pg_dump.zip
--boundary--

### 3. MONGO_DUMP アップロード
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="uploadType"

MONGO_DUMP
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="facilityCode"

NKKSBR
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="mongo_dump.zip"
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

< E:\tmp\uploads\mongo_dump.zip
--boundary--

### 4. FILES アップロード
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/upload
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="uploadType"

FILES
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="facilityCode"

NKKSBR
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="files.zip"
Content-Type: application/octet-stream

< E:\tmp\uploads\files.zip
--boundary--

### 5. JOB開始 (off2on)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "direction": "off2on",
  "facilityCodes": ["NKKSBR"],
  "uploadIds": {
    "pgDump": "upload-20260317-f09956",
    "mongoDump": "upload-20260317-f1f6ab",
    "files": "upload-20260317-00a540"
  }
}

### 6. JOBステータス確認
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/jobs/33
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. ログ確認
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/jobs/33/logs?offset=0&limit=100
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

